
# machine translated (French), not yet reviewed by a person.

# Reason shown when a picture of a kind that cannot be turned is turned.
folders-imaging-no-turn = Folders ne peut faire pivoter que les images JPEG, PNG, WebP et BMP

# Reason shown when a picture file could not be read for turning or resizing.
folders-imaging-unreadable = Folders n’a pas pu lire l’image

# Reason shown when a resized picture would have to be written in a kind Folders cannot write.
folders-imaging-no-write = Folders ne peut pas enregistrer ce type d’image

# Why a link to a picture is not turned.
folders-imaging-no-turn-link = c’est un lien, donc pivotez plutôt l’image vers laquelle il pointe

# Why a moving picture is not turned.
folders-imaging-no-turn-moving = Folders ne fait pas pivoter les images animées, car seule la première image serait conservée
